WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:33.958
In the previous few verses,
 Lord Krishna explained many things.

2
00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:36.791
He explained how people

3
00:00:36.791 --> 00:00:40.500
worship other gods and 
goddesses for material desires.

4
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.541
And along with this,

5
00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:44.333
we also learned how all these

6
00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:48.000
gods and goddesses, only because
 of Lord Krishna’s grace,

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.375
are able to provide humans

8
00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:51.541
their desired fruit.

9
00:00:51.541 --> 00:00:52.541
But

10
00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:53.291
Lord Krishna also

11
00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:55.750
called these people of little intelligence.

12
00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:58.208
Because, ignoring priceless gifts like the joy of union

13
00:00:58.208 --> 00:01:01.791
with Supreme Soul and liberation,
 these people are attracted

14
00:01:01.791 --> 00:01:03.250
toward perishable

15
00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:07.500
and momentary material things.

16
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:10.250
Now Lord Krishna is giving another example

17
00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:13.375
 of those of little intelligence getting confused,

18
00:01:13.375 --> 00:01:15.083
and this is related

19
00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:18.125
to Lord Krishna's form.

20
00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:24.541
Listen to this verse

21
00:01:24.541 --> 00:01:26.000
once again,

22
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:29.000
and after that we will understand it.

23
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:34.250
Avyaktam vyaktim āpannaṁ
 manyante mām abuddhayaḥ |

24
00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:38.708
Paraṁ bhāvam ajānanto
mamāvyayam anuttamam ||

25
00:01:38.708 --> 00:01:40.833
Avyaktaṁ vyaktim āpannaṁ –

26
00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:45.625
meaning 'What was unmanifest
 has now become manifest.'

27
00:01:45.625 --> 00:01:48.125
Lord Krishna is saying that some people

28
00:01:48.125 --> 00:01:49.250
believe

29
00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:52.500
that Lord Krishna was formless before and now

30
00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:56.333
He has assumed a physical form.

31
00:01:56.333 --> 00:02:00.375
Lord Krishna calls these people abuddhayaḥ,

32
00:02:00.375 --> 00:02:01.875
meaning there's a lack

33
00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:04.041
of proper intelligence in them.

34
00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:06.208
Why does Lord Krishna say this?

35
00:02:06.208 --> 00:02:08.750
The answer is in the next words.

36
00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:12.291
Paraṁ bhāvam ajānantaḥ, meaning

37
00:02:12.291 --> 00:02:14.875
those people don't know,
don't understand Lord Krishna's

38
00:02:14.875 --> 00:02:19.416
supreme form, His supreme nature.

39
00:02:19.416 --> 00:02:21.625
They can't recognize

40
00:02:21.625 --> 00:02:22.583
that Lord Krishna,

41
00:02:22.583 --> 00:02:25.500
even after manifesting in the material world,

42
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:27.833
is far beyond materiality,

43
00:02:27.833 --> 00:02:31.708
His divine, transcendental form is always present.

44
00:02:31.708 --> 00:02:35.208
And how is this divine form?

45
00:02:35.208 --> 00:02:38.541
Mamāvyayam anuttamam –
 meaning immortal

46
00:02:38.541 --> 00:02:42.666
and supreme, beyond all darkness.

47
00:02:42.666 --> 00:02:45.416
'Uttama' means 'best,'

48
00:02:45.416 --> 00:02:47.375
but Lord Krishna uses the word

49
00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:50.166
'anuttamam' for Himself,

50
00:02:50.166 --> 00:02:53.958
meaning above even the best.

51
00:02:53.958 --> 00:02:57.000
Those who consider Krishna's
 form as only material form

52
00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:00.000
cannot understand that His form

53
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:04.041
is transcendental, eternal, and pure.

54
00:03:04.041 --> 00:03:05.250
Here Lord Krishna

55
00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.750
is addressing two main philosophies –

56
00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:11.458
Brahmavāda and Māyāvāda.

57
00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:14.458
Brahmavāda is a philosophical ideology

58
00:03:14.458 --> 00:03:16.041
that values God's formless,

59
00:03:16.041 --> 00:03:19.041
all-pervading form,

60
00:03:19.041 --> 00:03:20.958
which is called Brahman.

61
00:03:20.958 --> 00:03:24.375
They either don't know God's manifest form

62
00:03:24.375 --> 00:03:27.166
or aren't attracted to it.

63
00:03:27.166 --> 00:03:30.416
But they also don't deny this form.

64
00:03:30.416 --> 00:03:32.250
Just understand

65
00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.791
that they're desirous of obtaining

66
00:03:33.791 --> 00:03:36.416
God's formless form only.

67
00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:39.833
Whereas Māyāvāda claims

68
00:03:39.833 --> 00:03:43.250
that God is only and only formless,

69
00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:45.833
and His manifest form is created by māyā

70
00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:47.583
and is temporary.

71
00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:48.750
They believe

72
00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.125
that by worshipping this manifest form,

73
00:03:51.125 --> 00:03:52.208
they'll merge

74
00:03:52.208 --> 00:03:55.041
into the featureless Brahman beyond it.

75
00:03:55.041 --> 00:03:57.625
Here Lord Krishna calls them

76
00:03:57.625 --> 00:03:58.833
abuddhayaḥ

77
00:03:58.833 --> 00:03:59.666
because these people

78
00:03:59.666 --> 00:04:02.250
simply cannot understand Lord Krishna's form.

79
00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:03.541
They think

80
00:04:03.541 --> 00:04:07.250
that Lord Krishna will be
 born like any other child,

81
00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.416
and ultimately

82
00:04:08.416 --> 00:04:09.708
His body too

83
00:04:09.708 --> 00:04:12.416
will end like other humans.

84
00:04:12.416 --> 00:04:14.083
This is a very big mistake.

85
00:04:14.083 --> 00:04:17.291
This mistake of Māyāvāda happens because

86
00:04:17.291 --> 00:04:20.666
they've only seen humans' material form,

87
00:04:20.666 --> 00:04:23.541
which takes birth and then gets destroyed.

88
00:04:23.541 --> 00:04:24.375
They simply cannot

89
00:04:24.375 --> 00:04:27.791
understand Lord Krishna's form.

90
00:04:27.791 --> 00:04:30.375
Whereas Lord Krishna is clarifying

91
00:04:30.375 --> 00:04:31.458
that His this form

92
00:04:31.458 --> 00:04:34.250
is avyayam, meaning indestructible.

93
00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.291
Lord Krishna doesn't take birth,

94
00:04:36.291 --> 00:04:38.583
He manifests by His own will.

95
00:04:38.583 --> 00:04:40.416
Manifesting in this world

96
00:04:40.416 --> 00:04:43.458
is one of His many līlās.

97
00:04:43.458 --> 00:04:45.083
This isn't māyā's illusion.

98
00:04:45.083 --> 00:04:47.166
Through this verse, Lord Krishna

99
00:04:47.166 --> 00:04:48.625
is clarifying

100
00:04:48.625 --> 00:04:50.125
that we shouldn't have misconceptions

101
00:04:50.125 --> 00:04:52.500
about His form.

102
00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:55.500
We shouldn't think like Māyāvāda

103
00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:58.416
that Lord Krishna's material form is limited,

104
00:04:58.416 --> 00:04:59.333
perishable,

105
00:04:59.333 --> 00:05:02.416
and has defects like humans in that form.

106
00:05:02.416 --> 00:05:07.166
Thinking this will only and only be our mistake.

107
00:05:07.166 --> 00:05:09.583
This may be difficult to grasp,

108
00:05:09.583 --> 00:05:11.750
but this is the truth – that Lord Krishna's

109
00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:14.958
this worldly form too is transcendental,

110
00:05:14.958 --> 00:05:16.166
divine.

111
00:05:16.166 --> 00:05:19.583
Just because it looks like human body form

112
00:05:19.583 --> 00:05:21.416
doesn't make it perishable or limited,

113
00:05:21.416 --> 00:05:24.083
because Lord Krishna is limitless.

114
00:05:24.083 --> 00:05:26.458
And this is Lord Krishna's supreme power –

115
00:05:26.458 --> 00:05:28.375
that He is formless

116
00:05:28.375 --> 00:05:30.166
and also has form.

117
00:05:30.166 --> 00:05:33.083
In every form He's transcendental, infinite,

118
00:05:33.083 --> 00:05:34.833
indestructible.

119
00:05:34.833 --> 00:05:36.250
If we're 

120
00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:38.333
unable to grasp this,

121
00:05:38.333 --> 00:05:41.083
then it's because of our limited thinking,

122
00:05:41.083 --> 00:05:43.875
and going forward in the Bhagavad Gita,
 remedy of these

123
00:05:43.875 --> 00:05:47.875
doubts of the mind will also happen.

124
00:05:52.416 --> 00:05:53.833
Some people,

125
00:05:53.833 --> 00:05:58.500
due to lack of intelligence, think

126
00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:02.958
that because My this form is manifest,

127
00:06:02.958 --> 00:06:06.000
therefore this form is only because of māyā,

128
00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:09.958
and this form is like destructible body,

129
00:06:09.958 --> 00:06:15.041
because according to them My real form is only

130
00:06:15.041 --> 00:06:19.583
formless.

131
00:06:19.583 --> 00:06:22.833
This is their lack of intelligence,

132
00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:25.875
because I, Krishna,

133
00:06:25.875 --> 00:06:29.208
am transcendental even in this manifest form,

134
00:06:29.208 --> 00:06:31.500
indestructible,

135
00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.958
My this body

136
00:06:33.958 --> 00:06:35.875
isn't perishable

137
00:06:35.875 --> 00:06:40.208
like humans'.

138
00:06:40.208 --> 00:06:41.916
But I can understand

139
00:06:41.916 --> 00:06:45.916
their this lack of intelligence.

140
00:06:45.916 --> 00:06:49.000
Those people have experienced manifest form

141
00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.875
only in materiality,

142
00:06:51.875 --> 00:06:55.375
and their experience says

143
00:06:55.375 --> 00:06:59.250
materiality is perishable. Whereas

144
00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.625
My this manifest form

145
00:07:01.625 --> 00:07:05.291
is also transcendental, also indestructible,

146
00:07:05.291 --> 00:07:08.458
and this thing is far beyond

147
00:07:08.458 --> 00:07:12.000
those people's intelligence and thinking.

148
00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:16.041
This often happens with humans in life.

149
00:07:16.041 --> 00:07:19.333
Your old experiences start determining

150
00:07:19.333 --> 00:07:23.708
your present and future perspective.

151
00:07:23.708 --> 00:07:25.166
For example,

152
00:07:25.166 --> 00:07:28.916
if you've been deceived before,

153
00:07:28.916 --> 00:07:30.750
then you start seeing this

154
00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.541
possibility in every person.

155
00:07:33.541 --> 00:07:36.500
Many times people make wrong notions

156
00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:40.291
in the name of men and women – that men

157
00:07:40.291 --> 00:07:41.750
are of this type,

158
00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.833
and women are of this type.

159
00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:46.125
Religion, caste,

160
00:07:46.125 --> 00:07:50.250
humans make many such wrong notions.

161
00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.333
Because either their old narrow

162
00:07:53.333 --> 00:07:55.041
experience says this,

163
00:07:55.041 --> 00:07:59.125
or they've heard such somewhere.

164
00:07:59.125 --> 00:08:02.750
People, due to their limited
 thinking and experience,

165
00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.458
consider even My this Krishna form

166
00:08:05.458 --> 00:08:07.625
as māyā,

167
00:08:07.625 --> 00:08:14.458
but this is their notion, certainly not truth.

168
00:08:14.458 --> 00:08:17.333
Similarly, know this –

169
00:08:17.333 --> 00:08:19.541
because of old experiences,

170
00:08:19.541 --> 00:08:21.958
if you also start determining

171
00:08:21.958 --> 00:08:27.125
new people’s personality or
 new situations’ results beforehand,

172
00:08:27.125 --> 00:08:31.875
then this is only your limited perspective.

173
00:08:31.875 --> 00:08:34.125
It's certainly not necessary

174
00:08:34.125 --> 00:08:35.916
that what you think

175
00:08:35.916 --> 00:08:37.250
is truth.

176
00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.708
Learn from your old experiences,

177
00:08:39.708 --> 00:08:43.208
there's also no harm in remaining alert, but

178
00:08:43.208 --> 00:08:45.791
don't make your old perspective so

179
00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:49.083
rigid that no possibility of change

180
00:08:49.083 --> 00:08:53.458
or newness remains in it.

181
00:08:53.458 --> 00:08:56.333
Because the meaning of progress is

182
00:08:56.333 --> 00:08:58.708
learning something new.

183
00:08:58.708 --> 00:09:02.500
So if you remained entangled in old perspective,

184
00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:04.875
then this progress will stop.

185
00:09:04.875 --> 00:09:06.916
Expand your thinking,

186
00:09:06.916 --> 00:09:09.625
invite new possibilities,

187
00:09:09.625 --> 00:09:12.500
remain ready to learn new things.

188
00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.333
Don't let the past

189
00:09:14.333 --> 00:09:17.666
dominate present and future.

190
00:09:17.666 --> 00:09:20.791
This is necessary for both personal

191
00:09:20.791 --> 00:09:23.250
and spiritual progress.

192
00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:24.833
See yourself,

193
00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:27.041
through this Gita you're adopting 

194
00:09:27.041 --> 00:09:29.250
new perspective,

195
00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:31.375
making personal and spiritual

196
00:09:31.375 --> 00:09:34.458
progress. Whereas someone else,

197
00:09:34.458 --> 00:09:36.875
in stubbornness of old perspective,

198
00:09:36.875 --> 00:09:39.541
will be denying this change,

199
00:09:39.541 --> 00:09:42.958
will remain deprived of life transformation.

200
00:09:42.958 --> 00:09:45.041
You're moving forward,

201
00:09:45.041 --> 00:09:46.791
keep moving.

202
00:09:51.083 --> 00:09:51.833
Some people

203
00:09:51.833 --> 00:09:55.000
make the very big mistake of considering

204
00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.375
My manifest Krishna form as material

205
00:09:57.375 --> 00:10:00.500
and temporary.

206
00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:04.041
This is their narrow perspective arising from

207
00:10:04.041 --> 00:10:08.166
limited experience of materiality.

208
00:10:08.166 --> 00:10:10.708
For them, manifest means

209
00:10:10.708 --> 00:10:16.750
material, and material means perishable.

210
00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:19.250
This is their misconception,

211
00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:22.583
whereas truth is different.

212
00:10:22.583 --> 00:10:24.166
Similarly,

213
00:10:24.166 --> 00:10:27.375
because of wrong misconceptions,

214
00:10:27.375 --> 00:10:32.500
family relationships also many times weaken.

215
00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:36.041
A small experience with someone got spoiled,

216
00:10:36.041 --> 00:10:40.041
so we declare that person bad.

217
00:10:40.041 --> 00:10:44.166
Heard something about some
 family member from someone,

218
00:10:44.166 --> 00:10:45.166
so we consider it

219
00:10:45.166 --> 00:10:48.708
truth and make a mindset.

220
00:10:48.708 --> 00:10:51.083
Such small things take the form

221
00:10:51.083 --> 00:10:55.041
of a perspective in the mind.

222
00:10:55.041 --> 00:10:56.958
Instead of trust for people,

223
00:10:56.958 --> 00:11:00.708
we fill the mind with doubt.

224
00:11:00.708 --> 00:11:02.750
If you consider your old misconceptions

225
00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:05.250
as truth,

226
00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:09.166
then bitterness coming in
 relationships is certain.

227
00:11:09.166 --> 00:11:13.583
Whereas family relationships should be sweet.

228
00:11:13.583 --> 00:11:18.333
So for this, keep three things in mind –

229
00:11:18.333 --> 00:11:20.000
First –

230
00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:24.000
don't make notions about people so rigid

231
00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:27.458
that you can never change them.

232
00:11:27.458 --> 00:11:29.083
Second –

233
00:11:29.083 --> 00:11:30.625
if there's some doubt in the mind,

234
00:11:30.625 --> 00:11:33.500
then try to remove it,

235
00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.000
have dialogue,

236
00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:37.916
see people from new perspective.

237
00:11:37.916 --> 00:11:40.166
And most important,

238
00:11:40.166 --> 00:11:42.125
don't spoil the future

239
00:11:42.125 --> 00:11:44.291
because of old experiences.

240
00:11:44.291 --> 00:11:47.250
Forgiving someone's mistake

241
00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:50.375
can also reawaken love.

242
00:11:50.375 --> 00:11:53.666
Don't deny love because of

243
00:11:53.666 --> 00:11:55.541
old discord.

244
00:11:59.958 --> 00:12:03.458
Some people come to understand

245
00:12:03.458 --> 00:12:06.416
that My manifest form

246
00:12:06.416 --> 00:12:08.250
is māyā,

247
00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:10.291
perishable.

248
00:12:10.291 --> 00:12:11.875
Because

249
00:12:11.875 --> 00:12:15.583
they're bound by their limited experience,

250
00:12:15.583 --> 00:12:19.041
bound by their old thinking.

251
00:12:19.041 --> 00:12:22.500
According to them, what's manifest

252
00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:26.083
simply cannot be indestructible.

253
00:12:26.083 --> 00:12:30.375
Whereas the truth is

254
00:12:30.375 --> 00:12:33.625
that My this manifest form too

255
00:12:33.625 --> 00:12:35.833
is infinite,

256
00:12:35.833 --> 00:12:37.625
indestructible.

257
00:12:37.625 --> 00:12:40.375
The sadness is

258
00:12:40.375 --> 00:12:43.000
that they want to keep their intelligence's doors

259
00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:45.458
closed,

260
00:12:45.458 --> 00:12:47.958
consider denying this possibility

261
00:12:47.958 --> 00:12:51.250
as right.

262
00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:52.750
Keeping your intelligence's doors

263
00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:56.250
open is extremely necessary,

264
00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.750
otherwise you'll become

265
00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.500
so rigid in your thoughts

266
00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:05.875
that the possibility of change itself will end.

267
00:13:05.875 --> 00:13:08.750
And in professional life,

268
00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:11.125
continuously learning something new,

269
00:13:11.125 --> 00:13:15.666
adopting new experiences,
 seeing new possibilities

270
00:13:15.666 --> 00:13:18.500
is extremely necessary.

271
00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:21.333
This is helpful in both forms –

272
00:13:21.333 --> 00:13:23.333
in personal progress also,

273
00:13:23.333 --> 00:13:25.958
and in the progress of people

274
00:13:25.958 --> 00:13:28.166
working with you also.

275
00:13:28.166 --> 00:13:31.916
Think, what's better –

276
00:13:31.916 --> 00:13:35.916
imposing your thoughts on colleagues

277
00:13:35.916 --> 00:13:39.375
or finding the right path

278
00:13:39.375 --> 00:13:42.291
from open dialogue.

279
00:13:42.291 --> 00:13:45.541
If you remained unnecessarily rigid,

280
00:13:45.541 --> 00:13:48.166
then neither will you learn something new,

281
00:13:48.166 --> 00:13:51.291
nor will people working with you.

282
00:13:51.291 --> 00:13:53.625
